1
00:00:00,322 --> 00:00:02,952
(Raj:)Oh, another two hours to go.

2
00:00:02,957 --> 00:00:04,827
(Raj:)The wait
is killing me.

3
00:00:04,826 --> 00:00:07,596
(Howard:)I know. I get it. When I was
in the Soyuz capsule

4
00:00:07,595 --> 00:00:10,165
(Howard:)returning from the space
station, plummeting toward Earth

5
00:00:10,165 --> 00:00:12,435
(Howard:)at 17,000 miles per hour...
Before you finish,

6
00:00:12,434 --> 00:00:15,264
(Raj:)is this a story about
patience and waiting

7
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:18,200
(Raj:)or just another reminder
that you went to space?

8
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:22,612
(Howard:)A story can
do two things.

9
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,610
(Raj:)Ugh, I feel like I'm gonna
have a heart attack.

10
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:26,612
(Howard:)You work in
pharmaceuticals--

11
00:00:26,614 --> 00:00:29,014
(Howard:)don't you have
anything you can give him?

12
00:00:29,017 --> 00:00:32,047
(Bernadette:)All I have is our new
urine flow drug.

13
00:00:33,488 --> 00:00:36,318
(Bernadette:)Won't help with his anxiety,
but it's so strong, when he pees

14
00:00:36,324 --> 00:00:38,754
(Bernadette:)he'll fly around the room
like he's got a jet pack.

15
00:00:40,495 --> 00:00:43,195
(Raj:)I can't stop thinking about it.

16
00:00:43,198 --> 00:00:45,998
(Bernadette:)You know, worrying won't
have any effect on what happens.

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,500
(Penny:)I know.
Maybe you need to do
something more productive.

18
00:00:49,504 --> 00:00:51,674
(sighs)
Okay.

19
00:00:51,673 --> 00:00:53,673
(Sheldon:)Ah.

20
00:00:53,675 --> 00:00:56,545
(Raj:)If I make this shot

21
00:00:56,544 --> 00:00:57,974
(Raj:)in the trash can,

